mple: relaxed, natural, confident, light pose)\n→ This lets the model understand \"people need emotions, not be stiff\"\n\n② Write one \"body state\"\n→ For example: slightly leaning forward, relaxed shoulders, natural smile\nThis makes the movements not stiff, not like a repeating machine\n\n③ Only give \"lighting + scene in one sentence\"\n→ For example: indoor natural light, hallway casual shot\nThis way the image feels like a real photo, not heavy AI flavor\nZ-Image will automatically give you that \"candid shot feel + micro-expression details\".\n\n\n\n\nExample:\n\nPositive Prompt: A natural film shot of a charming young woman (25-30 years old) with a youthful face and smooth skin. She wears a gorgeous deep burgundy sequined halter-neck evening gown. Her expression is confident, sexy, and elegant, exuding a sensual aura. The youthful appearance is captured in a lifestyle shot in a high-end hotel, a full-body shot of the model lying in bed, posing boldly. The expression is full of story and atmosphere, the body presents an S-curve, perfectly showcasing the waistline. Aesthetics and Technique: Natural film photography, using 35mm film, Kodak Portra 400, soft flash lighting, slight film grain. Realistic skin texture, visible pores, minor blemishes, unedited. Anti-AI style, snapshot aesthetics, high-fidelity detail. \n\n "], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "Prompt Tips", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [477.29296875, 357.4951477050781], "pos": [-383.33807373046875, 737.1209106445312], "id": 52, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["Base models\n\nGGUF: goes to ComfyUI/models/unet folder\nhttps://huggingface.co/jayn7/Z-Image-Turbo-GGUF/tree/main\n\nBF16: goes to ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models folder\nhttps://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/tree/main/split_files/diffusion_models\n\nFP8: goes to